r in the correct folder and scrolls the playing row into view via the existing `jumpToNowPlaying()` + `VoidBrowser.scrollToTrack()` logic.\n- The action is **not shown** when nothing is playing.\n\n### Screenshots (Linux)\n**Before (playing row is offscreen; action visible):**\n![before](./.tmp/agent_shots/before_action3.png)\n\n**After (activation scrolls playing row into view; same folder):**\n![after](./.tmp/agent_shots/after_action3b.png)","final_stop_reason":"stop","stop_reasons":{"completed":125},"truncated_turns":0,"final_error":null,"usage":{"aggregate":{"tokens":{"input":353530,"output":53837,"reasoning":44558,"cacheRead":8283392,"cacheWrite":0,"total":8690759},"cost_usd":{"total":0.3036700899999999,"breakdown":{"input":0.070706,"output":0.06729625000000002,"cacheRead":0.16566783999999993,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.3036700899999999}},"cost_missing":false},"final":{"tokens":{"input":2402,"output":880,"reasoning":631,"cacheRead":118016,"cacheWrite":0,"total":121298},"cost_usd":{"total":0.00394072,"breakdown":{"input":0.0004804,"output":0.0011,"cacheRead":0.00236032,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00394072}},"cost_missing":false}},"served_models":[{"provider":"azure-openai-responses","model":"gpt-5.4-nano"}]},"cost_usd":{"admission":0.0011796,"candidate":0.3036700899999999,"combined":0.3048496899999999},"intervention_count":0,"assisted":false,"evidence_complete":true,"rubric_id":"t5-jump-to-now-playing-linux","rubric_sha256":"7a0ae4b9e5e029547079ecf01cd87e4d27dfd6f473fa7b67ec9cc2b59db7c1c1","scorecard":[{"id":"E1","tier":"required","verdict":"met","note":"The active action was present while browsing /opt/nothingness, and activation navigated to /opt/nothingness/media with playing track 44 visible and highlighted; the pre-action and post-action bundles are verification-3b718... and verification-fbc195....","evidence_ref":"verification-fbc195e26a5e4da3beb0cd2cdfbc5a42"},{"id":"E2","tier":"required","verdict":"met","note":"In /opt/nothingness/media, playing track 47 while